From: Wine upstream contributors (see commit list)
Subject: [PATCH] Carry WineHQ graphics and input fixes that games reach.

Thirty-seven WineHQ commits from wine-11.1 to wine-11.20, applied
unchanged in upstream order; test-only hunks are omitted. They fix
rendering and input behaviour in wined3d, the d3d8/d3d9/ddraw/dxgi front
ends, dinput, xinput, hidclass, winebus, winexinput and
windows.gaming.input that earlier sweeps left out because they were not
crash, leak or hang fixes (maintainer decision 2026-10-26). 824d95cae5
is the helper b0642a4c6e extends, part of the upstream resolve series.
See docs/upstream-reviews.md, "Game-facing graphics and input fixes".

  8df796f0f8 (wine-11.1, SeongChan Lee): winebus: Use smallest report size for joystick axis.
  88e775dbdc (wine-11.1, SeongChan Lee): winebus: Use 16-bit relative axis range for bus_sdl.
  7f29964c15 (wine-11.1, Rémi Bernon): windows.gaming.input: Enfore axis usage mapping for HID devices.
  dec0864562 (wine-11.1, Elizabeth Figura): wined3d/glsl: Fix WINED3DTSS_TCI_SPHEREMAP calculation.
  f4626afec7 (wine-11.2, Elizabeth Figura): ddraw: Enumerate the ramp device.
  76f152e01f (wine-11.2, Elizabeth Figura): wined3d: Clear backup_dc and backup_wnd when deleting them.
  98a441ddf9 (wine-11.2, Zhiyi Zhang): wined3d: Reset internal_format_set when using the backup DC.
  62bf2b0545 (wine-11.3, Viktor Balogh): dinput: Return DIERR_UNSUPPORTED in dinput_device_Escape.
  7df175a66f (wine-11.3, Rémi Bernon): ddraw: Pass the active device to material_activate.
  24df29db09 (wine-11.3, Patrick Zacharias): wined3d: Access the right pixel format in swapchain_gl_present().
  0e1616f1f6 (wine-11.5, Robert Gerigk): hidclass.sys: Report correct device type for HID device objects.
  0ff2188fb1 (wine-11.6, Elizabeth Figura): wined3d: Do not force the source into RB_RESOLVED for a non-colour blit.
  824d95cae5 (wine-11.6, Elizabeth Figura): wined3d: Separate a raw_blitter_supported() helper.
  b0642a4c6e (wine-11.6, Elizabeth Figura): wined3d: Require matching sample counts for the raw blitter.
  78e5d7a1b6 (wine-11.6, Elizabeth Figura): wined3d: Move RB_RESOLVED logic from texture2d_blt() to texture2d_blt_fbo().
  58af62eb90 (wine-11.6, Elizabeth Figura): wined3d: Explicitly handle raw resolve in the FBO blitter.
  a7277ba021 (wine-11.8, Connor McAdams): dinput: Return E_FAIL when opening a joystick device that is currently disconnected.
  303b790376 (wine-11.9, Paul Gofman): ddraw: Do not render to the clipping window in exclusive fullscreen mode.
  77d56ec16f (wine-11.10, Paul Gofman): wined3d: Handle data aliasing when blitting to itself with FX transforms.
  b58c221630 (wine-11.11, Francisco Casas): wined3d: Don't use texelFetchOffset() for buffers and multi-sample textures.
  5279200712 (wine-11.11, Conor McCarthy): wined3d: Disallow locking of multisampled back buffers.
  6b486ec783 (wine-11.11, Paul Gofman): ddraw: Force render target bind flags on v1 swapchain candidate surfaces.
  4377bdebd6 (wine-11.11, SeongChan Lee): winexinput.sys: Fix handling of non-32-bit axis.
  ea50539dae (wine-11.12, Shaun Ren): xinput1_3: Keep controller read events across device changes.
  4241f00fb7 (wine-11.12, Shaun Ren): xinput1_3: Don't wait on overlapped event if CancelIoEx failed.
  1b79d86f73 (wine-11.12, Shaun Ren): xinput1_3: Clear enabled when controller is destroyed on read error.
  2b11697164 (wine-11.12, Shaun Ren): xinput1_3: Disable controller when removing an opened device.
  135ae82919 (wine-11.13, Thomas Portal): hidclass: Return the full report length from IOCTL_HID_WRITE_REPORT.
  020cbce1a9 (wine-11.13, Zhiyi Zhang): dxgi: Report the DXGI_SWAP_CHAIN_FULLSCREEN_DESC used for creating a D3D11 swapchain.
  c6e627b6d1 (wine-11.13, Zhiyi Zhang): dxgi: Create a windowed swapchain instead when the fullscreen mode scanline order or scaling is invalid.
  94f82f44e9 (wine-11.13, Zhiyi Zhang): dxgi: Refuse to enter fullscreen when the fullscreen mode scanline order or scaling is invalid.
  c5cb1e789e (wine-11.14, Kang Kang): dxgi: Return the first adapter from EnumWarpAdapter().
  b45d928aa1 (wine-11.16, Brendan McGrath): windows.gaming.input: Allow gamepad added callback to be registered before initializing providers.
  5335bc6551 (wine-11.19, Peter Wedder): dinput: Use link collections when reading HID joystick values.
  da5cdc1bde (wine-11.19, Peter Wedder): winebus: Put joystick hat switches in separate collections.
  365e610147 (wine-11.20, Evan Morse): ddraw: Stage execute buffer vertices at execute time.
  6b17d73c04 (wine-11.20, Kyle S. Cooper): ddraw: Fill system memory depth buffers on the CPU.

